{"id":"666140","name":"香菇炒肉沫","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/666140/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"香菇","amount":"十朵"},{"name":"肉沫","amount":"半斤"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"三个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香菇浸泡一夜。","img":"images/666140/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"捞出，挤出多余水分，切片，备用。","img":"images/666140/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜、葱和红枣辣椒切好，备用。","img":"images/666140/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"肉沫备用。","img":"images/666140/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅烧热放适量油，倒入肉沫加适量盐、老抽和少许胡椒粉，煸炒，再倒入葱、蒜和红辣椒炒香，继续倒入香菇翻炒片刻即可。","img":"images/666140/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"装盘即食。","img":"images/666140/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下饭菜。","img":"images/666140/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}